7,Ogbronuagum,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Ogbronuagum.htm,"Other comments: Ogbronuagum or Bukuma is spoken by approximately 12,000 speakers in Rivers state: Degema LGA, Bukuma village near Buguma, Nigeria. Ogbronuagum has a vigesimal numeral system.",Ogbronuagum,Niger-Congo
